<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<table width="597" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" height="333" style="text-size-adjust: 100%; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin: 0px; height: 333px; border: none !important; border-collapse: collapse !important;"><tbody><tr style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;"><td class="content-block" valign="top" width="596" height="279" style="text-size-adjust: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: top; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 20px; width: 596px; height: 279px;"><div id=":1cu" class="ii gt"><div id=":1ct" class="a3s aXjCH "><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr" align="left"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; text-size-adjust: 100%;"><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva;">Hello&nbsp;</span><font face="verdana, geneva">{!Contact.FirstName},</font></p><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; text-size-adjust: 100%;"><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva;"><br></span></p><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; text-size-adjust: 100%;"><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva;">Effective immediately, your EverQuote Pro account is now activated for the Lead Connection Service!</span></p><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; text-size-adjust: 100%;">&nbsp;</p><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; text-size-adjust: 100%;"><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva;">I’m happy to officially welcome you to the EverQuote Lead Connection Service (LCS). From this point forward, newly purchased leads will be sent simultaneously to your Pro account (and any other destinations specified in your Pro account - e.g., an LMS) and to our experienced Call Centers. We will work your leads for the first 7 days after you purchase them and will transfer them directly to your agency when we get a consumer on the phone.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; text-size-adjust: 100%;">&nbsp;</p><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; text-size-adjust: 100%;"><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva;">As a reminder:&nbsp;</span></p><ol><li style="text-size-adjust: 100%;"><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva;">To avoid duplication of outreach efforts, please refrain from making any contact attempts on new leads for the first 7 days</span></li><li style="text-size-adjust: 100%;"><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva;">You will see zip code adjustments in your campaign to include the full state (with the exception of exclusion zips); no changes will be made to your daily cap and pricing</span></li><li style="text-size-adjust: 100%;"><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva;">The LCS pilot will run for at least 60 days; we will be in touch at a later date with more information about the official end date for the pilot</span></li><li style="text-size-adjust: 100%;"><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva;">For a refresher on details about LCS, please reference the:</span><ol><li style="text-size-adjust: 100%;"><a href="https://go.everquote.com/lcspilot?utm_campaign=LCS%20Pilot&amp;utm_source=hs_email&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;_hsenc=p2ANqtz-8TNssx4aSmjSk7IxXRcR88Twko0DC55ZWnMdj1gDxnR1apjdxBxt97Qm1KOFupaDV5TvVT" rel=" noopener" data-hs-link-id="0" target="_blank" style="text-size-adjust: 100%; border-bottom: none;"><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva;">Lead Connection Service application form</span></a></li><li style="text-size-adjust: 100%;"><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva;"><a href="https://vimeo.com/420839428/ea5d23afe9?utm_campaign=LCS%20Pilot&amp;utm_source=hs_email&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;_hsenc=p2ANqtz-8TNssx4aSmjSk7IxXRcR88Twko0DC55ZWnMdj1gDxnR1apjdxBxt97Qm1KOFupaDV5TvVT" rel=" noopener" data-hs-link-id="0" target="_blank" style="text-size-adjust: 100%; border-bottom: none;">Pre-signup webinar presentation recording</a><br></span></li></ol></li></ol><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; text-size-adjust: 100%;"><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva;">If you have any questions or concerns, please contact our Support team at&nbsp;<a href="mailto:support@everquote.com" data-hs-link-id="0" target="_blank" style="text-size-adjust: 100%; border-bottom: none;">support@everquote.com</a>&nbsp;or 844-707-8800 (option 1).</span></p><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; text-size-adjust: 100%;">&nbsp;</p><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; text-size-adjust: 100%;"><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva;">Thank you for being a great partner of EverQuote. We appreciate your business.</span></p><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; text-size-adjust: 100%;">&nbsp;</p><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; text-size-adjust: 100%;"><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva;">Best,</span></p><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; text-size-adjust: 100%;">&nbsp;</p><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; text-size-adjust: 100%;"><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva;">Billy Hubbard</span></p><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; text-size-adjust: 100%;"><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva;">VP of Strategic Accounts</span></p></div></div></div></div></td></tr><tr style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;"></tr></tbody></table><br>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>